        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Additionally, we are subject to the CAN-SPAM Act, the Telephone Consumer Protection Act, and the Video Privacy Protection Act, each of which may place restrictions on how we operate in a manner that adversely affects our business.",
        "start_character": 29756,
        "end_character": 29986
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001828972-26-000030",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001828972-26-000030-dcd3a9b388bf4451",
        "accession_number": "0001828972-26-000030",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As a result, each of our brands has a large, loyal, highly engaged audience that is attractive to advertisers and creators, and through our rich first party data offering and contextual marketing solutions, we are able to help both advertisers and creators effectively and efficiently reach their target audiences.",
        "start_character": 1715,
        "end_character": 2029
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001828972-26-000030",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001828972-26-000030-dcd3a9b388bf4451",
        "accession_number": "0001828972-26-000030",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "If we, or the third parties we rely on to operate our business and deliver our services, fail to comply, or are perceived as failing to comply, with our legal or contractual obligations relating to data privacy and security, or our policies and documentation relating to personal information, we could face governmental enforcement action;",
        "start_character": 37309,
        "end_character": 37648
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001828972-26-000030",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001828972-26-000030-dcd3a9b388bf4451",
        "accession_number": "0001828972-26-000030",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In recent years, we have leveraged our media network to develop a comprehensive suite of digital advertising products and services and extend into complementary business lines, such as long-form content development and commerce.",
        "start_character": 10994,
        "end_character": 11222
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001828972-26-000030",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001828972-26-000030-dcd3a9b388bf4451",
        "accession_number": "0001828972-26-000030",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "It is therefore likely that, where we operate or provide services in those EU member state jurisdictions, we will need to comply with these local regulations in addition to the GDPR.",
        "start_character": 31156,
        "end_character": 31338
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001828972-26-000030",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001828972-26-000030-dcd3a9b388bf4451",
        "accession_number": "0001828972-26-000030",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We offer access to a range of wellness services addressing mental health, family support, child care, and other areas.",
        "start_character": 21218,
        "end_character": 21336
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001828972-26-000030",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001828972-26-000030-dcd3a9b388bf4451",
        "accession_number": "0001828972-26-000030",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "As audiences engage with our content, we capture insights into their preferences and apply those learnings to new content development.",
        "start_character": 7802,
        "end_character": 7936
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001828972-26-000030",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001828972-26-000030-dcd3a9b388bf4451",
        "accession_number": "0001828972-26-000030",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "BuzzFeed operates within the digital media space, a category that we have pioneered and helped develop.",
        "start_character": 17147,
        "end_character": 17250
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001828972-26-000030",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001828972-26-000030-dcd3a9b388bf4451",
        "accession_number": "0001828972-26-000030",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "For nearly 20 years, we have established a deep understanding of modern media and developed proprietary technology designed to rapidly scale and monetize digital content.",
        "start_character": 8536,
        "end_character": 8706
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001828972-26-000030",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001828972-26-000030-dcd3a9b388bf4451",
        "accession_number": "0001828972-26-000030",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In 2025, we continued to develop and launch key educational opportunities, including Identity and Allyship training, and host a myriad of Heritage Month educational events, learning opportunities, and social events sponsored by the DI&B team, BuzzFeed employee resource groups, and the DI&B Council.",
        "start_character": 24402,
        "end_character": 24701
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001828972-26-000030",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001828972-26-000030-dcd3a9b388bf4451",
        "accession_number": "0001828972-26-000030",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We are focused on supporting our employees across the full employee lifecycle from recruitment to onboarding through ongoing development, and have implemented programs designed to support both career satisfaction and overall wellness.",
        "start_character": 20983,
        "end_character": 21217
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001828972-26-000030",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001828972-26-000030-dcd3a9b388bf4451",
        "accession_number": "0001828972-26-000030",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We continually refine our approach to hiring, training, career development, and education to support our mission of DI&B.",
